<p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20names%202da" title="Background names 2da">background_names 2da</a> defines the default creature template for each race and class combination. 
</p><p>The background_names 2da file is not listed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has not been assigned a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_*</a> constant.
</p>
